    "intro_narrative": "You awaken with a start in a dimly lit Victorian study. Dust motes dance in the pale moonlight that streams through a single cracked windowpane, casting long, eerie shadows across the wooden floorboards. The heavy scent of aged parchment, oxidized copper, and dried ink hangs palpably in the cold air. The heavy oak door behind you is locked tight, leaving you trapped in this forgotten chamber of secrets. Your primary objective is clear: you must uncover the hidden contents secured deep within the heavy iron safe located in the corner of the room to secure your escape. \n\nHowever, this study is far from ordinary. Scattered across the mahogany desks and tucked away on sagging bookshelves are various peculiar contraptions, cryptographic devices, and locked compartments left behind by a paranoid inventor. To break the final seal, you will need to carefully observe your surroundings, piece together scattered clues, and master the enigmatic machinery that remains active. Every mechanism in this room was designed to test the wits of uninvited guests. Only by tracing the logic of the inventor's strange legacy can you hope to unlock the safe and find your way back to the outside world.",
    "narrative_style": "mystery"
  },
